    "scenesThatPass": [
      "STELLA: One hundred and eighty thousand dollars...that's a lot of lunches.\nSTELLA: What are those?\nAMANDA: Crabs. Peeky toes.\nSTELLA: This isn't about the bar, Amanda. It's about making your life cooking in this restaurant.",
      "CHRIS: It's a wonderful cause. We have so much and the Croats have so little.\nCHRIS: We'll see you on the sixteenth then; you're a dear.\nCHRIS: I had a few minutes before my facial so I'm downloading my schedule onto yours.\nLOIS: I hope you're using a condom.",
      "STELLA: You can think about it a little more..\nSTELLA: Oh, honey...\nAMANDA: I need some air.",
      "CHRIS: I don't care what you say. There's a girl. We're asking her.\nAMANDA: : Oh, God.\nCHRIS: Excuse me. Could you tell us...",
      "STELLA: So, how'd you hear about us?\nAMANDA: Sorry for the delay; it'll be a few more minutes. You're having the crab too?\nCHRIS: Chicken Paillard. It sounds safer. Until you get to know a place I don't think you should order seafood. I'm sure you feel the same way.\nSTELLA: Can I interest you in a martini?"
    ]
